<section class="hero hero-dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-split"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Cardi Smart Business Card</span><h1>Kartu nama yang cukup di-tap.</h1><p class="lead">Bagikan kontak dan profil dengan sekali tap NFC — terhubung ke Cardi Agent AI MoM.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/6281289895646?text=Halo%2C%20saya%20ingin%20memesan%20Cardi%20Smart%20Business%20Card.">Pesan via WhatsApp</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/cardimom/activation/">Aktivasi kartu</a></div></div><div class="hero-side"><div class="ph" style="min-height:280px">[FOTO KARTU NAMA NFC]</div></div></div></div></section><section class="sec "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class=eyebrow>Keunggulan</span><h2>Lebih dari kartu nama.</h2></div><div class="grid g3 "><article class="card "><div class="card-top"></div><h3>Tap untuk berbagi</h3><p>Kontak, WhatsApp, dan profil terbuka di ponsel penerima.</p></article><article class="card "><div class="card-top"></div><h3>Profil bisa diubah</h3><p>Ganti jabatan atau nomor tanpa cetak ulang.</p></article><article class="card "><div class="card-top"></div><h3>Terhubung ke MoM</h3><p>Kontak dari meeting tersimpan bersama notulennya.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="sec sec-white"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class=eyebrow>Detail</span><h2>Informasi pemesanan.</h2></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="tbl "><thead><tr><th scope=col>Item</th><th scope=col>Keterangan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=row>Harga</th><td>[HARGA]</td></tr><tr><th scope=row>Desain</th><td>[OPSI DESAIN / CUSTOM]</td></tr><tr><th scope=row>Pengiriman</th><td>[ESTIMASI PENGIRIMAN]</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
</Layout>
